# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Theramore Docks (1202), Parts of the Swarm (1184). Goblin Sponsorship (1178) and
# Wharfmaster Dizzywig (1111) are handed in at Ratchet on the way to the Booty Bay boat, in 03.
# Left out: Gizelton Caravan (5943), The Kolkar of Desolace (1362).
# Carved Centaur Totems (93225) and Ghost-o-plasm Round Up (6134) are worked at 38 on the Maraudine
# Scouts, Wranglers and Maulers (36-39) of the valley's eastern edge and on the Magrami Spectres
# (38-39), each with a tip to keep away from the elites beside them (Khan Hratha and the Rock Worms,
# 41-42; the Magram Necrokhans and Corpsefeeders, 45). The ghost-o-plasm comes last, after Mannoroc
# Coven just north of the Valley of Bones (#2357).

# Dustwallow at 35-36, after Stranglethorn (the 2026-11-07 re-order), then a top-up to 36 if needed
# and a short second Desolace visit for the zone's 37-40 quests at 36-38 (the 33-36 ones are in
# forever/horde/30-40/02-thousand-needles). Where only the top of a camp is two over you (the
# Maraudine Maulers, the spectres, the portal guardians, 38-39), the step says which to pull.
#
# Flow: Grom'gol (where the previous guide ends) -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (Soothing Spices) -> fly to the Crossroads (Korran) -> fly to Camp Taurajo -> the Shady
# Rest Inn -> Brackenwall Village (flight path) -> Reethe -> Witch Hill (Stinky) -> the Mirefin
# murlocs -> Swamplight Manor -> the spiders and venomspitters -> Brackenwall -> Swamplight
# Manor -> the Theramore docks -> Brackenwall -> fly to Ratchet (Stinky's Mebok;
# Warriors: The Affray on Fray Island) -> fly to Shadowprey Village (Taiga's Hand of Iruxos, Drulzegar's
# Other Fish to Fry) -> Ghost Walker Post (Gurda, Felgur) -> the Valley of Spears (Melizza) -> Hornizz ->
# Ghost Walker Post -> Thunder Axe Fortress -> Sar'theris Strand (the Slitherblade, 34-36, at 37-38: they
# were two over on the first visit at 33) -> Shadowprey (Taiga, Drulzegar) -> Mannoroc Coven -> the Valley of Bones -> Hornizz ->
# hearth to Shadowprey -> fly to Orgrimmar (Belgrom, Hunter and Shaman training),
# where the next guide takes the Undercity zeppelin.
#
# Class training: Hunters and Shamans in Orgrimmar at the end; Druids in Thunder Bluff on the
# flight from Shadowprey to Orgrimmar; everyone else in the Undercity at the start of the next
# guide.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar and the Crossroads

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 31.4,29.9 "Zeppelin to Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 51.5,45.6 "Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  buy 3713 x3 nearest                 -- Soothing Spices, for "Swamp Eye" Jarl
  accept 1718 only Warrior            -- Sorek, Valley of Honor: for Fray Island, later in this guide (offered from level 30)

step Fly to the Crossroads
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Crossroads"
  zone The Barrens

step Korran
  zone The Barrens
  tip Korran stands beside the Crossroads flight master.
  turnin 1148                         -- Korran
  accept 1184                         -- for Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar, at the end of this guide

step Fly to Camp Taurajo
  zone The Barrens
  goto 51.5,30.4 "Crossroads flight master"
  fly "Camp Taurajo"

step Dustwallow Marsh
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  goto 29.7,47.6 "Dustwallow Marsh"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Shady Rest Inn

step Shady Rest Inn
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Head east from Camp Taurajo along the road into the marsh. The burned-out Shady Rest Inn stands beside it just past the border; the shield, the badge and the hoofprints are in and beside the ruin.
  accept 1268
  accept 1251
  accept 1269

