# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back west

step Brackenwall Village: kill these as you meet them
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Head west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Lurkers (36-37) and Venomspitters (37-38) on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely.
  tip The Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes. Work its outer edge, where the Spiders and Recluses (35-37) stand: the Lurkers and Silkspinners (37-39) deeper in are two or three over you.
  tip Careful: Darkfang Lurkers (level 36-37) use Sneak to stealth while out of combat and cast Poison once fighting.
  tip Careful: Stealthed spiders in the same area will attack you on sight.
  tip Careful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them.
  collect 5959 quest 1322
  collect 5884 quest 1206
  kill 4834 quest 1201

step Brackenwall Village
  turnin 1238
  turnin 1201                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  accept 1202
  turnin 1322                         -- Do'gol
  accept 1323
  turnin 1323                         -- Krog

step Questioning Reethe
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip On the way east, Ogron waits in the Quagmire east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out: Private Hallan and Theramore Skirmishers (36) join it.
  accept 1273
  complete 1273 @42.6,38.1 map 1445

step Swamp Eye Jarl
  tip On east to the Swamplight Manor.
  accept 1239                         -- Loose Dirt, now that Nazeer has read the report
  turnin 1206
  accept 1203 optional                -- only if you carry a Moonsteel Broadsword (Blacksmithing or the Auction House)
  turnin 1203 optional

step The Theramore Docks
  tip South-east from the manor to Theramore Isle: the Captain's Footlocker lies on the sea floor off the docks on the isle's east side. Swim in and out and keep off the piers and the town: Theramore's guards are level 53-57, and a death here is a long run back from the spirit healer. Young Murk Threshers (40-41) circle in the water around the docks: grab the footlocker and swim straight out.
  collect 5882 quest 1202.1 @71.5,51.2 map 1445 -- Underwater

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Head back west to Brackenwall with the head: Mudcrush Durtfeet stands at the south edge of the village where the road comes in, Nazeer Bloodpike and Krog in the village.
  turnin 1177                         -- Mudcrush Durtfeet
  turnin 1202                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  turnin 1239                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  turnin 1273                         -- Krog
  accept 1240                         -- For Kin'weelay at Grom'gol, in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale

step Level 36
  when level<36
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Desolace's last quests are 36-39. Still below 36 after Brackenwall's hand-ins? The Drywallow Crocolisks (35-36) along the river east of the village are the closest at your level: kill them until level 36.
  goto 44.5,24.8 map 1445 "Drywallow Crocolisks"
  level 36 grind 4341                 -- grind on Drywallow Crocolisk

