# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace, the second visit

step Fly to Shadowprey Village
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to Shadowprey Village from the flight master you are next to: Ratchet's, or Brackenwall's if you had no errand in Ratchet.
  fly "Shadowprey Village"
  zone Desolace

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip Taiga Wisemane and Drulzegar Skraghook stand in the village.
  accept 5381                         -- Taiga Wisemane: the Hand of Iruxos, at Thunder Axe Fortress later on this visit
  accept 6143                         -- Drulzegar Skraghook: the Slitherblade of Sar'theris Strand, on the way back from Thunder Axe Fortress

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  tip East along the road to Ghost Walker Post; Gurda Wildmane stands beside Felgur Twocuts.
  accept 93225                        -- Gurda Wildmane
  accept 1366                         -- Felgur Twocuts: his Centaur Bounty, from the same Maraudine as Gurda's totems

step Valley of Spears
  zone Desolace
  tip West of the post, the Maraudine centaurs hold the Valley of Spears; every Maraudine can drop a Carved Centaur Totem and an ear for Felgur's Centaur Bounty. Stay with the Scouts and Wranglers (36-38) at the valley's eastern edge; the Maulers and Windchasers (38-39) a little further in are up to two over you at 37: pull them one at a time.
  tip Careful: Khan Hratha and the Rock Worms (41-42, elite) hold the valley's north-western end with the Khan Guards and Marauders (39-40), and the Magram's village in the south-east has Necromancers (42-43): keep east of the arrow.
  collect 254432 x5 quest 93225.1 @33.0,54.0 map 1443
  collect 6067 quest 1366

step Melizza Brimbuzzle
  zone Desolace
  tip Melizza is held in the Maraudine camp at the valley's western end; free her and escort her out east of the valley.
  tip Careful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.
  accept 6132
  complete 6132

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  zone Desolace
  tip Hornizz waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard.
  turnin 6132
  accept 6134                         -- Hornizz Brimbuzzle: the ghost-o-plasm, after Mannoroc Coven at the end of this visit

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  turnin 93225                        -- Gurda Wildmane
  turnin 1366                         -- Felgur Twocuts

step Thunder Axe Fortress
  zone Desolace
  tip North up the road to Thunder Axe Fortress. Clear the middle of the largest building, then use the Demon Pick on the red Hand of Iruxos Crystal there. A Demon Spirit (37) comes out: kill it for the Demon Box. The Burning Blade around it are well under you now.
  use 14523 quest 5381.1 @55.0,26.7 map 1443 -- Demon Pick, on the Hand of Iruxos Crystal
  collect 13542 quest 5381

step Sar'theris Strand
  zone Desolace
  tip West from the fortress to the coast at Sar'theris Strand: the Slitherblade Myrmidons, Naga and Sorceresses hold the beach. Pull them one at a time; the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36) cast from range.
  kill 4714 quest 6143.1
  kill 4711 quest 6143.2
  kill 4712 quest 6143.3

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip South down the coast to Shadowprey: Taiga takes the box and sends you to Mannoroc Coven with it; Drulzegar takes the naga.
  turnin 5381                         -- Taiga Wisemane
  turnin 6143                         -- Drulzegar Skraghook
  accept 5581

step Portals of the Legion
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east to Mannoroc Coven. With the Hand of Iruxos from Taiga in your bags, open a demon portal's ring: a Demon Portal Guardian (38-39) comes out; kill it to close that portal. Six portals. Careful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake.
  goto 52.0,78.0 "Mannoroc Coven"
  complete 5581

step The Valley of Bones
  zone Desolace
  tip South-east of the coven, the bone fields of the Valley of Bones, where Undead Ravagers roam, at Desolace's southern edge: keep south of the Magram's village on the way. Use the Crate of Ghost Magnets at the arrow to draw the Magrami Spectres (38-39): they come in numbers, so fight them with your back to the valley's edge. They drop the ghost-o-plasm.
  tip Careful: Magram Necrokhans and Corpsefeeders (45, elite) walk the bone fields just west of the arrow, well above you: use the crate at the arrow, on the valley's eastern side, and pull the spectres away from them.
  use 15848 quest 6134.1 @64.4,91.7 map 1443
  collect 15849 quest 6134 @64.4,91.7 map 1443 -- Ghost-o-plasm

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  zone Desolace
  tip North-west to the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard, back past Mannoroc Coven: keep west of the Magram's village.
  turnin 6134

step Shadowprey
  zone Desolace
  tip Hearth to Shadowprey: your hearthstone is still bound there.
  turnin 5581                         -- Taiga Wisemane

