step Belgrom Rockmaul
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Belgrom Rockmaul stands in the Valley of Honor.
  turnin 1184                         -- Belgrom Rockmaul

step Nogg
  when complete 2841
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Nogg's workshop is in the Valley of Honor beside Belgrom: hand in Rig Wars if you ran Gnomeregan.
  turnin 2841                         -- Nogg

step Orgrimmar trainers
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train while you are in the city; everyone else trains in the Undercity, next.
  train class
  note The next guide takes the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside the main gate.
